stdout:
stderr:
Usage of report:
  -compare string
    	compare against a baseline file or the word baseline
  -concurrency int
    	concurrent synthetic request workers for soak testing (default 1)
  -format string
    	report format: text, markdown, html, json (default "text")
  -include-data
    	include raw gathered app data appendix
  -json
    	print JSON output
  -last string
    	lookback window label for report output (default "30m")
  -loki string
    	Loki base URL for log evidence
  -prometheus string
    	Prometheus base URL (default "http://localhost:9090")
  -rate float
    	rate limit in requests per second for soak testing; 0 means unlimited. Unset defaults to 50 with --soak, unlimited otherwise (default -1)
  -service string
    	target service.name for scoped evidence
  -soak duration
    	sustained soak duration (requires --url)
  -tempo string
    	Tempo base URL for trace evidence
  -url string
    	target application URL for soak testing
